            <ArticleTitle>Procedural outcome and clinical results after stent deployment from the radial approach.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1088-90, A9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Multi-Link coronary stents, both 15 and 25 mm, can be used from the radial artery approach with a high degree of efficacy. The complexity of coronary artery stenting is greatly diminished by using the Multi-Link stent delivery system, which eliminates the need for &quot;bare stenting.&quot;</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
